      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "block_id": "tile_sql_style_conventions.r03.p1",
          "text": "An alias name should relate to the object it aliases. As a rule of thumb, use the first letter of each word in the object's name: orders → o, order_items → oi, customers → c. Always include the AS keyword to make the alias explicit: FROM orders AS o, not FROM orders o or FROM orders AS x.",
